HelpMenu:

MsgBox, 4096, Notification, `
(
Available Hotkeys:
- These will activate when you press the key.
Shift+F1 = Autofill Screener Import
Ctrl+Shift+S = Save contents of clipboard to secondary clipboard
Ctrl+Shift+V = Auto-type contents of secondary clipboard.
Alt+V = Auto-type contents of secondary clipboard with * prefix.
_______________
Shortkeys:
- These will auto-type text when you type them in a text field.
- Type the shortkey as it appears below to automatically enter notes.

