XENUSTEST - English \ United States
XENCATEST - English \ Canada
XFRCATEST - French \ Canada
XENMXTEST - English \ Mexico
XENAETEST - English \ United Arab Emirates
XENAUTEST - English \ Australia
XPTBRTEST - Portuguese \ Brazil
XFRFRTEST - French \ France
XDEDETEST - German \ Germany
XENGBTEST - English \ Great Britain
XNECTARTEST - English \ Great Britain (NECTAR)

